  "body": "<h2 id=\"h_01HBBXVWP1C3CQCZX1CPFX69H0\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ae6607;\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\">It's A Simple Task!</span></strong></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\">1. Press on your <strong>User Settings</strong> tab</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\">2. In the <strong>My Account</strong> tab of the <strong>User Settings</strong> menu, press that <strong>Edit</strong> button. </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\">3. Change that username! Think of a schnazzy new name and type it on in. </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\">4. Show Discord you mean business by adding your password.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"h_01J0KFCQA8532NYM9KDH9JN23V\"><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\"><strong>Important Note</strong>: Username changes are limited to 2 a week. </span></h3>",
